[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931855358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056#issuecomment-2931855358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107056","id":2931855358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uwI_-","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T18:04:06Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T18:04:06Z","body":"I'm not quite sure what the best fix for this is. It would seem to me that the fact that `ScriptServer` is just a bundle of static methods and variables is somewhat problematic, and should ideally be turned into a proper singleton with a well-defined lifetime instead. That would mean you could check against this singleton in places like `_err_print_error` before you try to do anything with it.\n\nAnother quick hack would be to exploit the fact that static initialization/destruction order is in fact defined for static variables in the same translation unit. That means you could do something like this at the bottom of all the static initialization in `script_language.cpp`:\n\n```cpp\nstatic bool is_program_exiting = false;\nstruct ProgramExitGuard {\n    ~ProgramExitGuard() {\n        is_program_exiting = true;\n    }\n};\nstatic ProgramExitGuard program_exit_guard;\n```\n\n... and check against `is_program_exiting` in any applicable `ScriptServer` methods.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931855358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931962987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056#issuecomment-2931962987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107056","id":2931962987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uwjRr","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T18:29:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T18:29:59Z","body":"@bruvzg If you happen to still be able to reproduce the exact crash you mentioned [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97210#pullrequestreview-2856326593), it would be great if you could try out #107058 to see if that fixes it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931962987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932052900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056#issuecomment-2932052900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107056","id":2932052900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uw5Ok","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T18:54:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T18:54:55Z","body":"Cc @lawnjelly @Ivorforce ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932052900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932180252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056#issuecomment-2932180252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107056","id":2932180252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uxYUc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T19:34:45Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T19:34:45Z","body":"> If you happen to still be able to reproduce the exact crash you mentioned https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97210#pullrequestreview-2856326593, it would be great if you could try out https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107058 to see if that fixes it.\n\nIt is constantly reproducible. Crash seems to be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107058.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932180252/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932232715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107056#issuecomment-2932232715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107056","id":2932232715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uxlIL","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T19:52:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T07:23:59Z","body":"Also see #106235.\n\nWe discussed this recently in core meeting, its a long term goal to address, there are a *lot* of SIOF bugs. Ideally we will solve with some coherent strategy.\n\nSome core team believe there are some c++20 features that will help, along with e.g. FixedArray for statics. I'm personally a fan of manual initialize order and terminate order for the app rather than relying on c++ for SIOF.\n\nPresently most non-trivial godot types are not safe to use with static lifetime, especially strings, variants, anything using memory allocation or ERR macros. Even printing currently relies on variants, which relies on pools, which may have been destroyed etc. The dependencies are long.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932232715/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]